{"complete_extracted_copy":false,"coverage":"centralized-copy","entries":{"audio-compressor.copy.body":{"context":"audio-compressor UI copy.body","source_hash":"f17bcc1bf4c99cb3cce11eaa863ebb564644c04befe5b857ab6190a6b0d7dce8","translation":"音频在您的浏览器中进行解码和重新编码;原始文件不会被上传或更改。 MP3 输出使用捆绑的本地编码器。 M4A/AAC 和 OGG/Opus 编码取决于您的浏览器中可用的编解码器。 重新编码可能会降低音质,结果可能会更大;除非更小,否则不会提供副本。 没有固定的服务器文件大小限制,但设备内存、速度、可用存储空间和浏览器编解码器支持是实际限制。"},"audio-compressor.copy.description":{"context":"audio-compressor UI copy.description","source_hash":"f7bdbb107b4045f2a10345f32c3f62b8b8965cbb6bed8aab459bda66684decb2","translation":"在浏览器中压缩 MP3、M4A 或 OGG 音频,选择更小的文件或更清晰的声音;您的原始音频保留在您的设备上。"},"audio-compressor.copy.intro":{"context":"Shared UI copy.intro","source_hash":"f9e0f8bf66fd660ae02abf78de3772ad4046a772fb31e5ee9c434ad38f4542bb","translation":"选择一个音频文件,选择输出格式和质量,然后在您的设备上保存一个单独的处理副本。"},"audio-compressor.copy.seo.faq.0.answer":{"context":"audio-compressor UI copy.seo.faq.0.answer","source_hash":"ac700a78d619faa9ff79426477b55b4269a2a45ef2e2a1288fd137f151ee2de2","translation":"选择音频文件,输出格式和质量,然后保存新副本。 处理在您的浏览器中本地运行;编解码器支持取决于您的设备和浏览器。"}},"locale":"zh-CN","missing":["audio-compressor.copy.title","audio-compressor.copy.shortTitle","audio-compressor.copy.seo.title","audio-compressor.copy.seo.description","audio-compressor.copy.seo.faq.0.question","audio-compressor.copy.seo.faq.1.question","audio-compressor.copy.seo.faq.1.answer","audio-compressor.copy.seo.faq.2.question","audio-compressor.copy.seo.faq.2.answer"],"native_review":false,"quality_policy":"0eeb566720322555f829a5a3be61f81c3c9d73a716a9e31c6a7419feb1ff5a59","release_approved":false,"schemaVersion":1,"semantic_policy":"36421db300bb5b4775311d883e0717d9efadde33b6766e5fd6d698175f610ed0","source_digest":"05bd0145ba07362f43d8b4d0a0df6cdc9d375aee5adba973b8c3cbb15325f3f7","toolId":"audio-compressor"}
